Turn Gambatte's dormant DUAL_MODE demo into a separately-built link prototype.

The prototype deliberately keeps the existing synchronous SerialIO contract so
we can measure the value of removing localhost TCP before changing emulator
timing. Both GBs receive separate libretro ports and run concurrently; only the
primary console is presented. Paired serialization and persistent workers are
follow-up work and this build is not yet shipped.

